Most people:  You want plugin-ubertooth

Testers / People running BLEEDING EDGE KISMET - you want
plugin-ubertooth-phyneutral!

Status (2026): both plugins are written against Kismet 2013-03-R1 (see
docs/source/third_party_software.rst). Kismet has since been rewritten,
and these plugins do not build against current releases. Nothing in this
tree builds them, and they are not tested. Channel hopping does not work
in either one: PacketSource_Ubertooth::SetChannel() has its channel
request commented out, yet it reports success. They are kept as they
were, for anyone running that older Kismet.
